# Vendored third-party assets (see src/greentechhub_ui/static/VENDORED.md) are
# pinned by SHA256. core.autocrlf normalizing their line endings on checkout
# would silently change their bytes and invalidate that pin, so they're
# marked binary — never touched by line-ending or diff conversion.
src/greentechhub_ui/static/css/*.min.css binary
src/greentechhub_ui/static/js/*.min.js binary
src/greentechhub_ui/static/icons/*.min.css binary
src/greentechhub_ui/static/icons/fonts/*.woff2 binary
